IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-WEBGL-AUDIO-JS.

DATA DIVISION.
01 VERTEX-COUNT        PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 AUDIO-FRAMES        PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 JS-ACCUMULATOR      PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 ENGINE-SCORE        PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-WEBGL-AUDIO-JS.
    IF VERTEX-COUNT == 0
        GO TO ENGINE-ERROR.
    END-IF.

    IF AUDIO-FRAMES == 0
        GO TO ENGINE-ERROR.
    END-IF.

    IF JS-ACCUMULATOR < 10
        GO TO ENGINE-ERROR.
    END-IF.

    MOVE 9995 TO ENGINE-SCORE.
    SET depth 2.
    WEIGHT 32 VERTEX-COUNT.
    WEIGHT 30 AUDIO-FRAMES.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 10.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ENGINE-ERROR.
    MOVE 0 TO ENGINE-SCORE.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
